WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.237 --> 00:00:02.320
(upbeat music)
(brand sizzles)

2
00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.957
Ever tried a DIY project and found yourself yelling,

3
00:00:05.957 --> 00:00:09.580
"D-I-why did I try this?"

4
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:13.680
Do-it-yourself expert, Jenni Yolo, has some helpful tips.

5
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.723
You're gonna wanna dip it in, brush it off a few times.

6
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:24.260 line:15%
We're gonna start in this corner and go at a 45-degree angle

7
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.343
and start our dashes.

8
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.550
I like to stay close to the line

9
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.530
but not necessarily hit it,

10
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:36.703
that way you won't get a cutoff dash.

11
00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.380
Okay, it looks really good.

12
00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:44.770
Not perfect, but that's what you want.

13
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.470
And now I'm gonna do the other side.

14
00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:51.470
So I like to match up so it creates almost an arrow.

15
00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.840
All right, one down,

16
00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.363
and I'm gonna finish the rest of the wall now.

17
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:02.580
We're gonna skip this one that we used as a guide

18
00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.990
and this one's gonna be the new center of our arrow

19
00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:08.040
so we'll start going down on this side

20
00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.730
and then we'll do the reflection on this side.

21
00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:12.203
And now we're done.

22
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.043
Now we're gonna pull off the tape.

23
00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:20.870
(pleasant music)

24
00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:22.390
The painted wall treatment is done

25
00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:24.390
and I brought everything into this room.

26
00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:28.490
I just love how the design ties it all together.

27
00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:30.240
Great tip, Chip and Joanna.

28
00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:32.040
Where can we watch more Jenni?

29
00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:34.740
Well, she hosts the Handcrafted Home Projects Workshop

30
00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.670
on the Magnolia app where you can learn

31
00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:39.690
how to make unique items for your home.

32
00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.859
Oh! D-I-why not?
(Chip laughs)

33
00:01:41.859 --> 00:01:44.526 line:15%
(upbeat music)

